                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great fun little roguelike game!\r\nMovement and mechanics are good, and it takes skill to avoid damage, it's not just run and shoot.\r\nThere're several ways of killing your enemies, and quite a few weapons and unlockables.\r\nThere are quite a lot of different enemies, and the new levels have new ones with new skills, keeping the combat interesting.\r\nGraphics are ok, not great but they serve well the game and the storyline.\r\nOnce I've got to the fourth and last comic book, I was forced to play it until defeating the final boss, which made me lose interest in re playing the previous levels, even though I hadn't complete them properly, just went through in a run. It took quite a lot of playing time from the game, I don't feel like playing it much now.\r\nStill, it was a fun time and I'd recommend the game for any Roguelike enthusiasts!\r\n",
